</parameterlist>
Invokes <computeroutput>func</computeroutput> inside a try/catch block. If <computeroutput>func</computeroutput> throws an exception of type <computeroutput>Exception_T</computeroutput>, the result is <computeroutput>true</computeroutput>; if it throws any other exception the result is <computeroutput>false</computeroutput>; if no exception is thrown the result is <computeroutput>false</computeroutput>. The result is passed to the <computeroutput><ref refid="structmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail_1_1callable__op" kindref="compound">callable_op</ref></computeroutput> base class constructor. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
